<title>USA: Portland General Elec names Fowler COO.</title>
<headline>Portland General Elec names Fowler COO.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portland General Electric said Peggy Fowler was named executive vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Fowler has held the position of senior vice president since 1995 when she was named to head customer service and delivery.</p>
